### def imaginary -> Matrix
### def imag -> Matrix

行列の虚部を返します。

```ruby title="例"
require 'matrix'
p Matrix[[1+2i, 1i, 0], [1, 2, 3]]
#  => 1+2i  i  0
#        1  2  3
p Matrix[[1+2i, 1i, 0], [1, 2, 3]].imaginary
#  =>   2i  i  0
#        0  0  0
```
